    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal combat, lots of blood and gore, big hordes of enemies, overpowered guns, fast movement,\u00a0destructible  foliage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 overpowered guns at your disposal right from the beginning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hordes of ferocious beasts: wendigos, shadowclaws, 5-headed hydras, and many others want to see you gutted!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old School Death Metal music: &quot;GUTS - Decay&quot; provided by Vargheist Records.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environments: dark forests, ancient ruins and gothic cathedrals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game made by one person - may contain issues.</h2>",
